==Battleground==
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Rui]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

